Z||000006||BAM-BAM||11-12-2001||01:21 PM||||As promised, a couple more!!<P>Notice Aus Fiero's shifter??? Slick!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/shifter-n-wheel.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/silverbullet.jpg"> <P>My Momo Commando Wheel!!! Very nice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/momowheel.jpg"> <P><BR>My Monsoons with Kumho Ecsta's<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/monsoon-n-ecsta.jpg"> <P>Well, that's all I have for now. Hope you all like it. It's been a labor of love.....and mucho denero!!!! Well, not to bad really  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||BAM-BAM||11-12-2001||01:30 PM|||| As for the dead pedal area, it wasn't available through ACC. However, I am going to add some after market ones or perhaps make some of my own. I don't want to wear out the carpet either. The mats are just for show, this is my daily driver so I will be getting a cheap set for daily use and use my Indian heads for special occasions. I should have Aus's Sub console in soon and that should pretty much complete the interior. Just some small things after that. Oh, except, I will be adding PISA's Wrap around dash later in 2002, I hope <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> . Now I can concentrate on the 3.4 which is about to be completed as well. Thanks for all the compliments and for those who wanted to know. The seats  are from Mr. Mike and ran $500.00. The carpet is from ACC and was about $265.00 complete with extra for the door panels. The mats ran me about $120.00 from ACC. Those are of the top of my head figures without pulling all the receipts.<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
