Z||000009||XDrewX||11-12-2001||02:02 PM||||I love those mats, very original idea.<P>I love all "Notchback GT's", they are my favorite.  Yours is especially nice with those rims and wing.<P>A few questions if you dont mind.<P>1. You have probably been asked this a million times, but, what type of wing is that, I am guessing an eagle talon, did you have to make modifications to it to make it fit?<P>2. Is your car lowered, if so, what did you use, because That has to be the most perfect sitting Fiero I have seen.  equal spacing at the front and rear wheel well.<P>3. What size rims and tires?<P><BR>Thanks,<BR>Peace, <P>Andrew||||reg||10
